<title>POLAND: OLAWA UNHARMED BY RECENT FLOOD WAVE.</title>
<headline>OLAWA UNHARMED BY RECENT FLOOD WAVE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish non-ferrous metals smelter Olawa SA was unharmed by the recent flooding in southwestern Poland, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>In recent days parts of the Wroclaw province, where Olawa is located, were flooded by the Odra river.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
